We need to add functionality to handle game-over overlay. This includes drawing background overlay, text "Game Over", "Final score", and "Press R or click Restart". The overlay should be drawn when phase is "gameover". We also need to have some logic to transition to gameover: That is in task 7, which hasn't been implemented yet (collision detection). But even if we don't have collisions yet, we still need to draw overlay if phase is "gameover". So we need to modify render function to conditionally overlay UI when phase === "gameover". Also need to stop active gameplay: that means stop the loop; but we haven't implemented startLoop auto-activation nor reset. Not yet. However we might want to later have the loop continue but not draw.

But per contract, need to dim background, display "Game Over", final score, and instructions.

